### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET seluruh lowongan
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET detail lowongan berdasarkan ID yang valid (ID = 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST menambahkan lowongan baru dengan data valid
POST {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posisi": "Mobile Flutter Developer Intern",
  "perusahaan": "Sinergi Media Kreasi",
  "lokasi": "Bandung",
  "tipe": "Hybrid",
  "durasi": 6,
  "gaji": 1600000,
  "deskripsi": "Mengembangkan fitur mobile aplikasi menggunakan framework Flutter dan berkolaborasi dengan backend engineer.",
  "skills": ["Flutter", "Dart", "REST API", "Git"]
}

### 4. POST dengan data tidak valid (Uji DTO validation - HTTP 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posisi": "AI",
  "perusahaan": "A",
  "lokasi": "J",
  "tipe": "Freelance",
  "durasi": 0,
  "gaji": -50000,
  "deskripsi": "Singkat",
  "skills": "BukanArray"
}

### 5. POST data duplikat (Uji ConflictException - HTTP 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lowongan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "posisi": "Quality Assurance Intern",
  "perusahaan": "NusaTech Solusi",
  "lokasi": "Yogyakarta",
  "tipe": "Onsite",
  "durasi": 3,
  "gaji": 1400000,
  "deskripsi": "Mencoba menambahkan data dengan posisi dan perusahaan yang sudah terdaftar.",
  "skills": ["Testing", "SQL"]
}

### 6. PATCH mengubah data lowongan (ID = 1)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lowongan/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gaji": 1750000,
  "durasi": 4,
  "deskripsi": "Melakukan pengujian fungsional dan automated testing aplikasi web secara berkala."
}

### 7. DELETE menghapus data lowongan (ID = 2)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lowongan/2
Accept: application/json

### 8. GET ID yang tidak tersedia (Uji NotFoundException - HTTP 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lowongan/999
Accept: application/json
